The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years. Our proposed approach allows for optimization of costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. We will ensure that the annual cost of exploitation remains mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority.

In conclusion, our company's expertise in AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, API integration, and environmental sustainability makes us a suitable partner for the City of Belval's initiative to implement an intelligent assistance tool for its municipal agents. Our proposed solution meets the city's requirements for high availability, low latency, and environmental responsibility while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and optimizing costs.
